@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About Us";
    ViewData["PageTitle"] = "About JobPortal";
}

<div class="page-content animate-fade-in">
    <div class="page-header">
        <h1 class="page-title">
            <span class="page-title-icon">
                <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
                    <path d="M12 16v-4"></path>
                    <path d="M12 8h.01"></path>
                </svg>
            </span>
            About JobPortal
        </h1>
        <p class="page-subtitle">Connecting talent with opportunity since 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="content-card">
        <section class="policy-section">
            <h2>Our Mission</h2>
            <p>At JobPortal, we believe that finding the right job shouldn't be a struggle. Our mission is to create a seamless, transparent, and human-centered platform that connects talented professionals with meaningful career opportunities.</p>
            <p>We understand that behind every resume is a person with dreams, goals, and a unique story. And behind every job posting is a team looking for someone to help them grow. Our job is to bridge that gap with technology that's intelligent, intuitive, and genuinely helpful.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
            <h2>Our Values</h2>
            <div class="values-grid">
                <div class="value-card">
                    <div class="value-icon primary">
                        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3>Transparency</h3>
                    <p>We believe in open, honest communication. No hidden fees, no hidden agendas.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="value-card">
                    <div class="value-icon success">
                        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3>Excellence</h3>
                    <p>We strive for excellence in everything we do, from our code to our customer service.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="value-card">
                    <div class="value-icon warning">
                        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3>Empathy</h3>
                    <p>We put people first. Every feature we build starts with understanding real human needs.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="value-card">
                    <div class="value-icon info">
                        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"></line><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"></line><polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"></polyline></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3>Innovation</h3>
                    <p>We continuously push boundaries to create better ways to connect talent with opportunity.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
            <h2>Our Story</h2>
            <p>JobPortal was founded in 2026 by a team of developers, designers, and HR professionals who experienced the frustrations of job hunting and hiring firsthand. We saw a market full of outdated platforms, spammy listings, and impersonal processes.</p>
            <p>We set out to build something different: a platform that respects both candidates and employers, uses AI responsibly to match skills with needs, and treats every user with the respect they deserve.</p>
            <p>Today, we're proud to serve thousands of job seekers and employers, helping them find their perfect match every day.</        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
            <h2>Our Team</h2>
            <p>We're a diverse team of engineers, designers, product managers, and HR experts united by a shared vision. We work remotely across multiple time zones, practice what we preach about flexible work, and are always looking for talented people who share our values.</p>
            <p style="margin-top: 1rem;"><strong>Want to join us?</strong> Check out our <a href="/Jobs" style="color: var(--color-primary);">careers page</a> for open positions.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
            <h2>Get in Touch</h2>
            <p>We'd love to hear from you! Whether you have feedback, questions, or just want to say hello.</p>
            <div class="contact-info">
                <p><strong>Email:</strong> hello@jobportal.com</p>
                <p><strong>Support:</strong> support@jobportal.com</p>
                <p><strong>Press:</strong> press@jobportal.com</p>
                <p><strong>Careers:</strong> careers@jobportal.com</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <div class="policy-footer">
            <p>JobPortal &copy; 2026. Built with passion for people everywhere.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<style>
.page-content {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 1rem;
}

.content-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-primary);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: 2.5rem;
}

.policy-section {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-primary);
}

.policy-section:last-of-type {
    border-bottom: none;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    padding-bottom: 0;
}

.policy-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

.policy-section p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

.values-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
}

.value-card {
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-primary);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    transition: all var(--transition-normal);
}

.value-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
    border-color: var(--color-primary);
}

.value-icon {
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin: 0 auto 1rem;
    color: white;
}

.value-icon.primary { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary), var(--color-primary-light)); }
.value-icon.success { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-success), #34d399); }
.value-icon.warning { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-warning), #fbbf24); }
.value-icon.info { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-info), #22d3ee); }

.value-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}

.value-card p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    margin: 0;
}

.contact-info {
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
}

.contact-info p {
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
}

@@media (max-width: 640px) {
    .content-card {
        padding: 1.5rem;
    }
}
</style>